gui.the_long_travail.catalog.glossary.fl:
Deal additional damage equal to the actual damage at the time of triggering.
Pending repeats end if:
- The wearer removes The Long Travail or Everlasting Flower;
- The wearer loses Flourishing Witness;
- The wearer or target dies, leaves the loaded area, or leaves the dimension where the damage occurred.

gui.the_long_travail.catalog.glossary.ev:
Marked items:
- Do not lose durability;
- Do not break from a large single durability cost;
- Resist fire, lava, and explosions as dropped items;
- Do not naturally despawn as dropped items.
Crafting, placement, and consumption through use are not protected.
Items lost to the void remain unrecoverable.
